<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8068" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνέγκλη-τος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>without reproach, blameless,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				6.1.13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				2.14
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαφυλάττειν τοὺς πολίτας ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					1360a16
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἑαυτὸν παρέχειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					22.1271
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>CIG</u>
				2270.7
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Delos</span>). Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					17.2
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				436
			</span></i>. 
			<i><span class="en">
				6
			</span></i> (Delph., <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>PIand.</u>
				33.14
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>giving no ground for dispute,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τὰς οὐσίας πρὸς ἀλλήλους
					κατασκευάζεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					737a
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως, ἔχειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1321b22
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				Act.
			 in Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>”
				<i>uncomplainingly,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.102e
				</span></i>
			.</div>
